The Embedded Portal expects payload.header and payload.lines.

Therefore, after workflows run, convert the internal workflow payload to this portal response shape:

{
  "success": true,
  "operation": "extract_map_preview",
  "status": "Requires Review",
  "message": "Quote processed. Please review the lines.",
